{"id":162,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"質実剛健の校風で個性を伸ばす天王寺中","feature_description":"大阪教育大学附属天王寺中学校は「質実剛健」の校風の下、基礎学力を固め、個性と協調性を育てることを理念に掲げます。日頃の学習や多彩な行事、自然体験的な学習を通じて、自己を確立し、確かな学力と仲間と成長する力を養います。大学附属の研究校として実験的な授業や教育実習を行うことも、公式に示された学校の使命です。附属校として教育研究の一端も担います。","clubs":[{"id":2928,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2929,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2930,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2931,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2932,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2933,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2934,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2935,"name":"映像部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2936,"name":"情報科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2937,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":2938,"name":"美術工芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14582,"name":"地域探究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://f.osaka-kyoiku.ac.jp/tennoji-j/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":699,"attribute_key":"uniform